        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 11:2",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Whatsoever parteth the hoof, and is clovenfooted, and cheweth the cud, among the beasts, that shall ye eat.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 53
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 11:3",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Nevertheless these shall ye not eat of them that chew the cud, or of them that divide the hoof: as the camel, because he cheweth the cud, but divideth not the hoof; he is unclean unto you.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 96,
            "end": 98
          },
          {
            "start": 168,
            "end": 170
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 11:4",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "And the coney, because he cheweth the cud, but divideth not the hoof; he is unclean unto you.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 73,
            "end": 75
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 11:5",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "And the hare, because he cheweth the cud, but divideth not the hoof; he is unclean unto you.",
